{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A pluggable persistence backend for offline document state."}],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Yorkie\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Yorkie\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Inherits From","type":"inheritsFrom"},{"kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/MemoryDocStore"],"title":"Conforming Types","type":"conformingTypes"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DocStore","kind":"identifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sendable","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It is deliberately a snapshot plus an append-only change log rather than one opaque"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"blob. Re-serializing the whole document on every edit costs time proportional to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"document – hundreds of milliseconds on a large one – and a document is at its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"largest while it is being edited, which is exactly when the writes happen. Appending"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"costs the size of one change, which does not grow with the document at all."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The interface stays byte-oriented and async so a durable backend can implement it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"without the client knowing which storage it talks to, and so a backend is free to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"compress or encrypt what it is handed. The default ","type":"text"},{"isActiv